# Miner's Guidewing dies (Bolt, in Bot2's end step) and its trigger makes Bot1's Memnite explore (CR 701.44a): the top card is a land (Plains),
# so it goes into Bot1's hand and the Memnite gets no counter, staying a 1/1. The Guidewing's controller is the one exploring, not Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Miner's Guidewing
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Plains
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Miner's Guidewing.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Miner's Guidewing)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Miner's Guidewing; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Plains
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Stack.Count = 0
